as too little computation to hide a PCIe transfer, so the useful policy is to keep the experts a workload comes back to. LRU also gives a simple way to estimate the value of more memory. From a reference trace, the reuse-distance histogram determines the miss curve m(C): how many references would miss at resident cap C. We use this miss-curve view for the expert stream, and use the analogous block-level view for KV, with the\nadmission floor below capturing the scheduler cliff that a smooth miss curve misses.\n3.3 The Expert↔KV Split\nA split f gives C=f B/a expert slots per layer and κ= (1−f)B/b KV blocks. The allocator asks a simple question: if we move one byte from KV to experts, do we remove more latency than if we leave that byte in KV?\nLet mexp(C) be the expert miss count at cap C, and let mkv(κ) be the KV miss or recompute cost induced by a KV pool of κ blocks. Expert misses and KV misses have different costs. An expert miss transfers weights over PCIe, with cost cexp =M etbyte. A KV miss costs recomputation, with costc kv =βb tok. The latency model at splitfis\nT(f) =c exp mexp(C) +c kv mkv(κ).(2)\nThe best split depends on the workload. Short tool-call bursts have little KV pressure and benefit from keeping more reused experts resident, so the optimum shifts expert-heavy. Long-context or multi-turn workloads put more pressure on KV, so the optimum shifts back toward KV. At an interior\n低资源 MoE 服务的工作集分页\n专家\n1\n专家\n2\n专家\nN\n专家\n3\nKV 交换区(主机 DRAM)\n主机(CPU)\n设备 (GPU)\nF : 非专家权重与激活 保留 (不在 B 中)\nS : 专家暂存区 (活跃专家)\n专家映射 拆分 f\nK:KV 池(设备端)\nfB\n(1 ‐ f )B\n可分页\n预算 B\n页调入(H2D, PCIe)\nKV 拆分 / 恢复\n(溢出、PCIe)\n(a)系统布局\nFS K\nK 最小 值\n拆分 f(高)\n专家压力\n工具调用突发, 短上下文 →f 高\nFS K\nK 最小 值\n拆分 f (低)\nKV 压力\n长上下文 多轮 → f 低\nB\nFS K\nK 最小\nB\ntime\n之前\nFS K\nK 最小\nB\n之后 动态\n控制器\n将两个 池调整为 耗尽屏障\n耗尽 屏障\n活跃专家 KV 缓存 固定权重 +\n激活值\n(b) 运行时状态:MV‐WSA 移动分割点\n图 1. WiSP 概览。(a) 系统布局。完整的专家权重固定驻留在主机上;WiSP 仅通过 PCIe 将路由到的专家分页到小型 GPU 暂存区 S ,并通过专家映射 π 运行未经修改的融合 MoE 内核,因此输出字节级一致。可分页预算 B = Bexp + Bkv—— 专