专家分页机制只需要被路由的专家,因此其适用范围超 越了纯文本的MoE大语言模型。在Kimi‐VL‐A3B上,同一 个vLLM插件即可对MoE语言主干进行分页,无需任何模 型特定代码,在文本和图像提示上均保持输出不变,并 在匹配预算下提升了解码吞吐量(第5.2节)。在混合架 构Jamba‐v0.1(52B;Mamba+attention+MoE)上, WiSP能够在单张94GiB GPU上服务该模型,而这是原生 vLLM无法做到的:全量驻留会超出显存,且CPU卸载路 径不支持Jamba的循环状态。这一能力声明仅限于该混 合模型。对于没有自回归KV缓存的MoE扩散模型,完整 的专家–KV分配问题并不适用,但分页器仍然有效。一个 约150行的PyTorch封装即可对DiT‐MoE和\n\n\n Working-Set Paging for Low-Resource MoE Serving\nFigure 3. Iso-VRAM decode throughput on Qwen3-30B-A3B, measured on a real 24 GiB RTX 3090 (PCIe 4.0). When the model does not fit, routing-aware paging (WiSP) moves fewer bytes per step than static layer-level offload. At a matched ≈22 GiB budget, WiSP decodes ≈2.0× faster (cap 32: 9.93 vs. offload 44: 4.93 tok/s). Within the range this card can hold, increasing the expert cap improves WiSP throughput (cap 8/16/32 → 6.0/7.6/9.9 tok/s), while the routing-blind baseline remains bandwidth-limited. A 24 GiB card cannot reach the full-footprint budget where the model fits and static residency wins; WiSP targets the sub-fitting regime, not a universal speedup.\nLLaDA-MoE-7B; generation remains bit-/token-identical to full residency, while resident expert memory drops by up to 4×. These models also expose different working-set structures: DiT has a fully activated per-forward stream with little cross-step reuse, while LLaDA has strong temporal locality across denoising steps. AppendixFreports the full mechanism-generalization results (Figures4,5).\n6 CONCLUSION\nServing an MoE on a GPU that cannot keep it resident is a working-set problem: routed expert weights and the KV cache are two memory-demand streams competing for one small store. WiSP realizes this view for the low-concurrency regime. It pages routed experts through a drop-in, byteidentical vLLM plug-in, improves decode throughput by up to 2.0× over static offload at matched VRAM on a real 24 GiB GPU, and carries the same expert-paging mechanism to a MoE VLM, a 52B hybrid model whose stock vLLM path cannot serve it on one GPU, and two diffusion MoEs as mechanism-generalization checks.\nThe main lesson is that in single-stream, memory-bound decode, routing prediction is not the speed lever. There is too little compute to hide PCIe transfers, so the routing signal is more useful as a memory signal: it tells us which expert working set is worth keeping resident. That makes allocation the central problem. MV-WSA splits one VRAM budget between resident experts and KV under an admission floor, and the live controller shows that this split can be changed while serving without changing model outputs. Porting the full estimator into the live serve loop, broadening the\ndynamic controller beyond the current proof of concept, and validating the MiniMax regime on physically smaller GPUs are the next steps.\nREFERENCES\nAnthony, Q., Tokpanov, Y., Glorioso, P., and Millidge, B. BlackMamba: Mixture of experts for state-space models. arXiv preprint arXiv:2402.01771, 2024.\nCao, S., Liu, S., Griggs, T., Schafhalter, P., Liu, X., Sheng, Y., Gonzalez, J. E., Zaharia, M., and Stoica, I. MoELightning: High-throughput MoE inference on memoryconstrained GPUs. InACM International Conference on Architectural Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems (ASPLOS), 2025.\nDeepSeek-AI. DeepSeek-V3 technical report.arXiv preprint arXiv:2412.19437, 2024.\nDenning, P. J. The working set model for program behavior. Communications of the ACM, 11(5):323–333, 1968.\nDenning, P. J. Virtual memory.ACM Computing Surveys, 2 (3):153–189, 1970.\nDu, Z. et al. SiDA: Sparsity-inspired data-aware serving for efficient and scalable large Mixture-of-Experts models. In Proceedings of Machine Learning and Systems (MLSys), 2024.\nEliseev, A. and Mazur, D. Fast inference of Mixture-ofExperts language models with offloading.arXiv preprint arXiv:2312.17238, 2023.\n面向低资源 MoE 服务的 Working-Set 分页\n图 3. Qwen3‐30B‐A3B 在真实 24 GiB RTX 3090(PCIe 4.0)上的等 VRAM 解码吞吐量。当模型无法完全放入显存时,路由感知分页 (WiSP)每步移动的字节数少于静态层级卸载。在匹配的 ≈22 GiB 预算下,WiSP 解码速度更快(cap 32:9.93 对比 offload 44: 4.93 tok/s)。在该卡可容纳的范围内,提高专家上限可提升 WiSP 吞吐量(cap 8/16/32 → 6.0/7.6/9.9 tok/s),而路由盲基线仍受带 宽限制。24 GiB 显卡无法达到模型完全放入且静态常驻胜出的全量预算;WiSP 针对的是次适配场景,而非通用加速。\nLLaDA‐MoE‐7B进行分页;生成结果与全量驻留保持逐 位/逐token完全一致,而驻留专家内存最多降低 4×。这 些模型还展现出不同的工作集结构:DiT具有完全激活的 逐前向流,跨步复用很少,而LLaDA在去噪步骤间具有 强时间局部性。附录F报告了完整的机制泛化结果(图 4、图5)。\n6 结论\n在无法将其常驻的GPU上服务MoE是一个工作集问题: 路由专家权重和KV缓存是两条竞争同一小块存储的内 存需求流。WiSP在低并发场景下实现了这一视角。它 通过一个即插即用、字节级一致的vLLM插件对路由专 家进行分页,在真实的24GiB GPU上以匹配的显存将 解码吞吐量相比静态卸载提升最高达 2.0× ,并将相同 的专家分页机制推广到一个MoE VLM、一个52B混合 模型(其原生vLLM路径无法在单GPU上服务)以及两 个扩散MoE,作为机制泛化性验证。\n主要教训在于,在单流、内存受限的解码中,路由预 测并非提速的关键。可用于隐藏PCIe传输的计算量太 少,因此路由信号更适合作为内存信号:它告诉我们 哪些专家工作集值得常驻。这使得分配成为核心问题。 MV‐WSA在准入下限约束下,将一个VRAM预算分配 给常驻专家和KV,而实时控制器表明,这一分配可以 在服务过程中改变,而不改变模型输出。将完整的估 计器移植到实时服务循环中、将\n动态控制器扩展到当前概念验证之外,并在物理尺寸 更小的GPU上验证MiniMax方案,是接下来的步骤。\n参考文献 Anthony, Q.、Tokpanov, Y.、Glorioso, P. 和 Millidge, B. BlackMamba:面向状态空间模型的混合专家。arXiv预 印本 arXiv:2402.01771,2024。\nCao, S., Liu, S., Griggs, T., Schafhalter, P., Liu, X., Sheng, Y., Gonzalez, J. E., Zaharia, M., and Stoica, I. MoE‐Lightning: 在内存受限GPU上的高吞 吐量MoE推理。载于ACM编程语言与操作系统架构支 持国际会议(ASPLOS),2025年。\nDeepSeek‐AI。DeepSeek‐V3技术报告。arXiv预印本 arXiv:2412.19437,2024。Denning, P. J. 程序行 为的工作集模型。ACM通讯,11(5):323–333, 1968。Denning, P. J. 虚拟内存。ACM计算综述, 2(3):153–189,1970。Du, Z.等。SiDA:面向稀疏 性的数据感知服务,用于高效且可扩展的大型混合专 家模型。载于机器学习系统会议论文集(MLSys), 2024。Eliseev, A.和Mazur, D. 基于卸载的混合专家 语言模型快速推理。arXiv预印本arXiv:2312.17238, 2023。\n\n\n Working-Set Paging for Low-Resource MoE Serving\nFedus, W., Zoph, B., and Shazeer, N. Switch transformers: Scaling to trillion parameter models with simple and efficient sparsity.Journal of Machine Learning Research (JMLR), 23:1–39, 2022.\nFei, Z., Fan, M., Yu, C., Li, D., and Huang, J. Scaling diffusion transformers to 16 billion parameters (DiT-MoE). arXiv preprint arXiv:2407.11633, 2024.\nGerganov, G. et al. llama.cpp. https://github.com/ ggml-org/llama.cpp, 2023.\nHuang, Y., Fang, Z., Luo, W., Wu, R., Chen, W., and Zheng, Z. DyMoE: Dynamic expert orchestration with mixed